%% Intrak V2 - Document Approval Workflow Activity Diagram
%% Paste this into: https://mermaid.live/

flowchart TD
    Start([Student Starts]) --> SelectDoc[Select Document to Upload]
    SelectDoc --> ValidateFile{Validate File<br/>Size & Type}
    
    ValidateFile -->|Invalid| ShowError[Show Error Message]
    ShowError --> SelectDoc
    
    ValidateFile -->|Valid| UploadFile[Upload File to Server]
    UploadFile --> SaveFile[Save File to Storage]
    SaveFile --> CreateRecord[Create Document Record<br/>Status: PENDING]
    CreateRecord --> NotifyReviewer[Notify Reviewer<br/>via Email]
    NotifyReviewer --> WaitReview{Wait for Review}
    
    WaitReview --> CheckStatus[Reviewer Views Document]
    CheckStatus --> ReviewDoc{Review Document}
    
    ReviewDoc -->|Needs Changes| RequestChanges[Request Resubmission<br/>Status: RESUBMISSION_REQUESTED]
    RequestChanges --> NotifyStudent1[Notify Student]
    NotifyStudent1 --> StudentAction{Student Action}
    
    StudentAction -->|Resubmit| SelectDoc
    StudentAction -->|Cancel| End([End])
    
    ReviewDoc -->|Approve| ApproveDoc[Approve Document<br/>Status: APPROVED]
    ApproveDoc --> NotifyStudent2[Notify Student<br/>via Email]
    NotifyStudent2 --> UpdateHours[Update Student Progress<br/>if applicable]
    UpdateHours --> End
    
    ReviewDoc -->|Reject| RejectDoc[Reject Document<br/>Status: REJECTED]
    RejectDoc --> AddRemarks[Add Rejection Remarks]
    AddRemarks --> NotifyStudent3[Notify Student<br/>via Email]
    NotifyStudent3 --> End
    
    style Start fill:#90EE90
    style End fill:#FFB6C1
    style ValidateFile fill:#FFE4B5
    style ReviewDoc fill:#FFE4B5
    style StudentAction fill:#FFE4B5
    style CreateRecord fill:#87CEEB
    style ApproveDoc fill:#90EE90
    style RejectDoc fill:#FF6B6B


